10806_363182968852538317_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VyBAC6Es8TkQ7kNvwHkxpk2&_nc_oc=AdpQcTQXlhK3t9NWaC0WMV3pCXFOuMKfn6NEY5ya-n-ISh7gu4Gi1i3gZTpPDT0Jv-M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5D18pPJPJUBpOlgXE3PbUMxr4a86lHhQOPXDEMfqOYVA&oe=6A11C107"}, {"file_name": "Crossbow_ScreenShot.png", "id": "2397984983893950", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391978_2397984990560616_3969625957978599437_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_RqPUigVntAQ7kNvwGeRC13&_nc_oc=Adr8aG0qwH8tr-_TLRoxwZQeYjpA8mMWA7L8ndhMh3uuIPV8dHi_6KDUKSw929eg0Zg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5cPcQLHlFDbpolTYeF_ZFMdQgGmm-b5JCngtLoHEAEZQ&oe=6A11C6AD"}, {"file_name": "Olympic_ScreenShot.png", "id": "648582874300164", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392305_648582880966830_2648986520125630881_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wZeRt33S7gIQ7kNvwHi7KrO&_nc_oc=Adpw20Joj8h0kEFoYvgY_x3dR_6pQcXeSCOtm8L8fMLcTcrrjjgAHio5X1s6mkzB3vo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af51Ri1x793kn_gEJufTMlTDh9-JR8Yd4UKO61pp10-swA&oe=6A11C5A1"}, {"file_name": "BallonPop_Screenshot.png", "id": "2053609291789381", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391967_2053609295122714_5342321999149614343_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S1jb0XW3yJcQ7kNvwFOrb9Q&_nc_oc=Adr26wKneVJVByAMQ0sctjbL6wUfFOjYSjYdhWKh8xW129BqYAtC_Ss-iAYQxJq4gYA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7LHXdJTD_Q9FMaMe2ucU27v4m0g44vkLLtFkU3dQWZgA&oe=6A11A038"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLogo_Landscape.png", "id": "616531301220959", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391901_616531307887625_1642505082054004162_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HWqQPSYoGaoQ7kNvwFk0gBq&_nc_oc=AdqU2_O5RdzGcG9f3YrwEZhfedVEV-Hnmrg8gUn0TIUCLs2MZ4h_vN0Y6jOreyptoAk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5i95Z45oRFq0Wr7HFDUHyr9Nn94CwdcPU7tb6rYgqupg&oe=6A11A103"}, "display_name": "vArcher", "keywords": ["archery", "bow", "arrow", "archer", "simulator"], "long_description": "A Comprehensive archery range simulation featuring multiple customizable bows, arrows and targets.  Physically accurate parameters let you experience shooting bows from the comfort of home. \n\n**Customizable Arrows:**\n- Choose from a variety of tips, shafts, fletchings and nocks\n- Each part contributes to the total weight and properties of the arrow\n\n**Bows:**\n- English Long Bow\n- Recurve Bow\n- Compound Bow\n- Japanese Yumi\n- Medieval Crossbow\n\n**Tuning and Tweaking**\n- Customize bow parameters like Draw Weight, Draw Length and IBO Speed to match your real bow setup or get a feel for a new one\n- Hone the perfect shot with features like string-walking, multiple string release methods and micro offsets for hand positions\n- Add attachments like stabilizers, sights and more\n- Save and load multiple configurations for each bow\n\n**Ranges and Targets**\n- Includes Indoor and Outdoor ranges with customizable targets and distances\n- Freely place targets in The Sandbox Range for a unique 3D shooting experience\n- Choose from a variety of targets like standard Rounds, tumbling blocks, playing cards, balloons and of course, Apples\n- Get instant shot feedback for Bullseye targets via hit marker displays\n\n**Challenge Ranges**\n- Test your skill in a variety of special challenges and chase high scores", "short_description": "A Comprehensive archery range simulation featuring multiple customizable bows, arrows and targets.  Physically accurate parameters let you experience shooting bows from the comfort of home. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.meatspacevr.com/varcher-privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Meatspace Interactive"